+# Task (C02)
+
+Document the API in the README.
+
+Scope: README.md
diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 85d2aea..28e6628 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -4,3 +4,11 @@ A small stdlib Python HTTP service, written from scratch to verify the llm-code-
 `GET /up`, `POST /v1/quote` (weight bands × zone, quantity/promo discounts, Decimal money), `GET /v1/quote/<id>`
 (SQLite), a per-client token bucket. Its `Taskfile.yml` implements the check contract
 (`check:fast` / `check` / `ci` / `image`). Not a real product.
+
+## API
+
+| Method | Path | Body | Response |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| GET | `/up` | — | `{"status": "ok"}` |
+| POST | `/v1/quote` | `{"weight_kg": 1.5, "zone": "eu", "quantity": 2, "promo": "WELCOME10"}` | 201 with id, unit_price, subtotal, discount, total |
+| GET | `/v1/quote/<id>` | — | the stored quote or 404 |
